# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local Cloudflare previews (`npm run cf:preview`).
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored; this example is not. Never put real secrets here.
#
# On the real host these live in the platform's environment settings:
#   Cloudflare -> Workers -> ccdgroup -> Settings -> Variables
#   Vercel     -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables

# CMS sign-in. From the GitHub OAuth App (docs/CMS-SETUP.md).
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=local_test_client_id
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=local_test_client_secret

# Contact-form storage. WITHOUT THESE, form submissions are not saved and
# visitors are told to email instead. See ccd-website/supabase/schema.sql.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=
